 * Typed augmentation for Vite's ImportMeta so TypeScript knows about our
 * custom VITE_* variables.  Place this in a *.d.ts file (e.g. src/vite-env.d.ts)
 * or keep it here with a triple-slash reference – shown inline for clarity.
