### Key decisions explained

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE_URL` | The only way to read env vars in Vite client code; Vite statically replaces these at build time. `process.env` is **not** available. |
| Fail-fast guard at module load | A missing URL would produce confusing network errors at runtime; an explicit `Error` surfaces the misconfiguration immediately. |
