| `Omit<RequestInit, 'body'>` + `body?: unknown` | Allows callers to pass any serialisable value instead of `BodyInit`, keeping the API ergonomic. |
| `new Headers(headers)` | Safely merges caller-supplied headers before conditionally injecting `Content-Type`, avoiding mutation of the caller's object. |

