 * Read the base URL at module initialisation time.
 *
 * import.meta.env is a Vite-specific object; it is fully typed when you add
 * the reference below to env.d.ts.  A missing or empty value is a
 * programmer/configuration error, so we throw immediately rather than
 * silently falling back to a wrong URL.
 */
