### How the three `import.meta.hot` hooks cooperate

| Hook | When it runs | Responsibility here |
|---|---|---|
| `import.meta.hot.accept(cb)` | After Vite re-evaluates this file | Calls `newModule.setup()` so the *new* code takes effect |
| `import.meta.hot.dispose(cb)` | Before the old instance is discarded | Saves `previousTimestamp` into `data`; calls `teardown()` |
| `import.meta.hot.data` | Readable in the incoming instance | Lets the new instance log or act on state from the old one |

